  "required_next_steps": [
    "Use the D04-approved OpenGrok 1.14.20 baseline at commit 3ca9d73ebb0ddb5560fbc7631322d29d9fdc2ec3. Preserve functionality and style except D02's explicit exclusion of user-role/project ACL management and mandatory authorization/RBAC plugin parity; retain non-auth plugin inventory. Complete the remaining D20 compatibility contracts.",
    "Apply local+LAN support, about five concurrent users without role/project ACL management, bundled helpers and search-speed priority. Production deployment prioritizes Ubuntu 24.04 amd64; first develop and fully validate on confirmed Apple M1/arm64 macOS (aarch64-apple-darwin), then adapt Ubuntu and repeat complete native validation. Use the observed development macOS 15.7.7 and user-confirmed Windows 11 x64; complete minimum macOS, Windows build/ABI and native environments under D03, D16 concrete controls for confirmed local-browser-only web management, D06/D07 details and remaining D20 compatibility. Record the actual Ubuntu point release with runtime evidence. Helper builds, numeric SLO, workload, hardware and tradeoffs remain open; five users is neither five QPS nor a hard limit.",
    "Source bytes and OpenGrok release archive were independently verified on 2026-11-01. Complete the remaining full-JDK/dependency acquisition and independent oracle index/HTTP evidence.",
    "Select exact Java/Tomcat/Ctags/SCM builds only as needed to run the independent reference oracle; record source, license and binary metadata.",
    "Run separate native oracle and Rust compatibility/performance experiments first for Apple M1/arm64 macOS, then complete Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 platform adaptation and native revalidation. Preserve independent evidence per platform; Mac PASS is not Linux PASS. Prioritize full-text/path/defs/cross-project search while recording indexing and resource tradeoffs.",
    "Create a separate approved Rust toolchain/Cargo/native-artifact lock after concrete technology selection; do not treat this file as that lock.",
    "Preserve the verified initial planning receipt for https://github.com/swchen44/rustgrok/commit/526f619089703f710c915af303e54aea7d25226e (tree 3af8b051938022e067b29a8ccc4d7acac51205b2, 46 files read back with matching Git blob SHAs). Initial planning content is COMMITTED_AND_TREE_VERIFIED. Save subsequent receipt-only changes in a later commit without inventing its SHA. GitHub Release and product artifact publication remain incomplete."
  ],
